<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss National Bank leaves discount rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Swiss National Bank leaves discount rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank said it had left its discount rate unchanged at 1.0 percent at its weekly board meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no change,&quot; a bank spokesman said after the meeting.</p>
<p>There is no meeting next week, he added.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected the SNB to leave rates unchanged after it said last week it had already done its part to spur the stagnant Swiss economy through generous monetary policy.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
